    "id": "10058592",
    "original": "「『ひまり』って、どんな字書くの？」「えっとね、太陽の『陽』に『万』。一万、二万のね。『莉』は草冠に『利』」「草冠に『り』？」「のぎへんにりっとう」「ああっ！ジャスミンの！」「ジャスミン？」「なんでもない。気にしないで」",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "10123517",
        "text": "\"How d'ya write 'Himari'?\" \"Uh, the second character in 'sun,' and then the character that goes 'man.' Y'know, like ten thousand, twenty thousand and so on. Then the 'ri' part is the 'ri' with a grass radical.\" \"'Ri' with a grass radical?\" \"Yeah, with the grain stalk radical and the sword part on the right\" \"Oh! From Jasmine!\" \"Jasmine?\" \"Nothing. Don't worry about it.\""
